<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Using serif fonts as a base */
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 1em;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: center;">Sample Cover Letter 1</p>
  <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">Copy heading from your resume</p>

  <p>January 1, {{ current_date }}</p>

  <p>Name</p>
  <p>Title</p>
  <p>Company</p>
  <p>Address</p>
  <p>City, State Zip</p>

  <p>Dear Mr. {{ hiring_manager_title }}:</p>

  <p>After carefully reviewing the description for the {{ job_position }} position with {{ company_name }} Corporation on the {{ university_name }} University Career Development Service's Handshake website, I am submitting my resume for your review and consideration. I believe that my work background and skills are ideally suited for this opportunity.</p>

  <p>As my resume shows, I am a {{ student_status }} student with a unique combination of technical and customer service skills. In my role as a {{ role_title }} with {{ company_name }}, I perform various duties, including...</p>

  <p>I am confident that my education and skills are well aligned with this position and would allow me to make immediate contributions to {{ company_name }}. I welcome the opportunity to speak and you and hope to hear from you soon.</p>

  <p>Sincerely,</p>

  <p>Take a picture of your signature on clean white paper (use a fine point black Sharpie) and insert the jpg of your signature here</p>

  <p>Type your full name here</p>
  <p>Enclosure</p>
</div>